OL,3,GNEWSABoy's joy at getting lead role in
OL,4,Aplay aged nine
OL,5,
OL,6,FA nine-year-old who landed a leading
OL,7,Frole in a play with no professional
OL,8,Facting experience says he "screamed the
OL,9,Fhouse down" when he found out.
OL,11,FAtlas Johnson-Dutfield from Bristol is
OL,12,Fsharing the role of Lanny with fellow
OL,13,Fyoungster Lucian Thomas, 10, in the
OL,14,Fstage adaptation of Max Porter's
OL,15,Facclaimed novel Lanny.
OL,17,FAtlas' mum Jada Johnson-Dutfield said
OL,18,Fshe initially "felt sick" with nerves
OL,19,Fwhen watching him perform - but this
OL,20,Fwas then overtaken by pride.
OL,23,APub: 29-OctQppppppppppppppppppppppG1/2
